\def\@LN@column{1}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Illustration of the empirically executed fungicide application pattern, documented by field investigators immediately after each grower-implemented spray event in the experimental vineyard in Du'an, Hechi City, during the 2022 growing season. The management practice was characterized by preventive fungicide applications conducted after rainfall events and before the onset of first visible symptoms. The shaded region indicates the corresponding pre-symptomatic period of rainfall-triggered preventive sprays. DOY 128 is the start of the observed symptom-onset window (DOY 128--131); the first symptom-positive assessment was on DOY 131.}}{15}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{_Ref214272651}{{7}{15}{Illustration of the empirically executed fungicide application pattern, documented by field investigators immediately after each grower-implemented spray event in the experimental vineyard in Du'an, Hechi City, during the 2022 growing season. The management practice was characterized by preventive fungicide applications conducted after rainfall events and before the onset of first visible symptoms. The shaded region indicates the corresponding pre-symptomatic period of rainfall-triggered preventive sprays. DOY 128 is the start of the observed symptom-onset window (DOY 128--131); the first symptom-positive assessment was on DOY 131}{figure.caption.10}{}}
